note Scalar OSC IR v1 unit. Threshold is passed from the shared feed contract.
note Inputs are integer milliseconds; JS rounds fractional elapsed age upward,
note preserving the strict stale comparison against the integer threshold.
note Backwards source timestamps retain priority over an interrupted fetch.
fn fresh now_ms long gen_ms long prev_ms long stale_ms long fetch_ok bool to uint
if lt gen_ms prev_ms
ret uint 2
end
if not fetch_ok
ret uint 3
end
if gt now_ms gen_ms
if gt sub now_ms gen_ms stale_ms
ret uint 1
end
end
ret uint 0
end
